ared to the simple RNN and LSTM neural networks. However, the simple RNN and LSTM neural networks could predict the target sequence perfectly with fewer recurrent units than the GRU neural network. Overall, these results may provide insights into how the nervous system optimally encodes sequences of items.  ","topics":[],"score":181180,"global_rank":418172},{"name":"allaway/giphy-allowlist","owner":"allaway","html_url":"https://github.com/allaway/giphy-allowlist","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"An allowlist/whitelist to pair with a pan-facebook blocklist.","topics":[],"score":181180,"global_rank":418173},{"name":"kennthhz-zz/workflow","owner":"kennthhz-zz","html_url":"https://github.com/kennthhz-zz/workflow","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"a common workflow framework","topics":[],"score":181180,"global_rank":418174},{"name":"jersonmorrow/hooks-training","owner":"jersonmorrow","html_url":"https://github.com/jersonmorrow/hooks-training","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":181180,"global_rank":418175},{"name":"jutley/jutley","owner":"jutley","html_url":"https://github.com/jutley/jutley","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":181180,"global_rank":418176},{"name":"alextorreswa/github-practice","owner":"alextorreswa","html_url":"https://github.com/alextorreswa/github-practice","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":181180,"global_rank":418177},{"name":"ltxom/ltxom","owner":"ltxom","html_url":"https://github.com/ltxom/ltxom","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":181180,"global_rank":418178},{"name":"ianliuy/Simple-Distributed-System","owner":"ianliuy","html_url":"https://github.com/ianliuy/Simple-Distributed-System","stars":0,"fork